I have just finished playing this great game, and would
like to offer some humble ideas for a possible extension.

In stories, dragons are great monstrous things sitting on
huge piles of treasures (i.e. the "Hobbit").  
Why not have monsters such as "ancient red dragon"
sitting in rooms stacked full of nice goodies.
These creatures would be very hard to kill, but
the adventurous hacker could talk to them (#chat)
to find out things.  THere will be of course a
chance that the hacker would get charmed, and donate
his items to the treasure trove.  The Dragon's
true name would disarm him, and could be found
scrawled in some odd corner of the dungeon,
or given by the gods .       This could
go well with the idea of the quest, i.e. go
kill the dragon of the opposite alingment to you.


Simon Michnowicz


